# Only what the build needs. Everything else makes the context bigger and the
# cache worse, and some of it must never be in an image at all.
#
# Two contexts read this file, not one: the server image (../Dockerfile) and
# the benchmark rig's load generator (bench/Dockerfile), which is built from
# this same root because it imports this repository's own client. The last
# three lines are for that second build and are copied by nothing in the
# server image — sapedb.go is the client package, bench/ is the load
# generator, and the server's Dockerfile names neither.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!internal/
!cmd/
!sapedb.go
!bench/
